---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — VidMedical"
  description="VidMedical Studio is a small team of medical professionals and editors creating short, medically accurate explainer videos for health practices."
>
  <section class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-signal">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
        A studio for medical social video.
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p>
          VidMedical is a small but capable studio team that brings together medical professionals
          and editors / motion designers. We create high-retention short videos that are medically
          accurate and clear enough for patients to follow on a phone screen — with physician-led QA
          on every piece before it goes out.
        </p>
        <p>
          Practices come to us for procedure walkthroughs, biomechanics explainers, treatment
          education, and patient-facing clips shaped for Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, and
          TikTok. Whether you record on your phone, share a voiceover, or send a written outline, we
          help turn that material into something ready to post.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our work stays email-friendly and easy to manage alongside clinic days, with clear tiers
          and two rounds of revisions on every video so collaboration feels calm and predictable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 border-t border-ink/10 pt-12 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Medically fact-checked</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Physician-led QA and clear teaching sit at the center of every edit, so your audience
            can trust what they are watching.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Built for social</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Vertical, caption-ready, and paced for Reels, Shorts, and TikTok — deliverables you can
            publish with confidence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Clear and collaborative</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Simple tiers, included revision rounds, and a straightforward process designed to feel
            supportive rather than complicated.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
